turtle-agent file | Detour source | how
internal/navmesh/detour/Include/*.h (DetourAlloc, Assert, Common, Math, NavMesh, NavMeshQuery, Node, Status) | Detour/Include | copied unchanged from the core
internal/navmesh/detour/Source/*.cpp (DetourAlloc, Assert, Common, NavMesh, NavMeshQuery, Node) | Detour/Source | copied unchanged from the core (DetourNavMeshBuilder left out: tiles are read, never built)
internal/navmesh/detour/recastnavigation.diff | dep/recastnavigation/recastnavigation.diff | copied unchanged: the core's alterations of recastnavigation, in DetourNavMesh.h and DetourNavMeshQuery.cpp, and in Recast/Include/Recast.h, which is not vendored here (zlib clause 2)
internal/navmesh/detour_*.cpp | - | new: one-line wrappers that compile each Detour source in the cgo package

internal/spells/names.tsv.gz lists spell ids and names, generated by tools/spellnamegen from
sql/base/tw_world_spell_template.sql of tortoise-wow (https://github.com/tortoise-wow/tortoise-wow). The names are
World of Warcraft game data, as the 1.12 client's Spell.dbc holds them; no code of the core is included.

tools/tbmcontract/mock.lua is the mock of the 1.12 widget API from tests/regression.lua of
TortoiseBotsManager (https://github.com/Sagiroth/TortoiseBotsManager), trimmed, used under the MIT License.
The addon itself is not included: tools/tbmcontract/fetch.sh downloads it at test time.

